  "skos:prefLabel": "Desolvation System",
  "skos:definition": "Desolvating nebulizer or membrane desolvator used upstream of the plasma to reduce solvent load. Lowers oxide production rates and increases sensitivity, and is commonly used for low-abundance analytes or small sample sizes. Note the trade-off: desolvation can introduce additional instrumental mass ",
